<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38056" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-tango</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, tactum, 3, v.
				a., <i>to touch beforehand</i> or <i>previously</i> (postclass.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Cael.
				Aur. Tard. 5, 7, 81</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">leviter oleo Hispano praetactus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 4, 3, 22</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>to attack;</i> of
			violent diseases: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praetacta nervositas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
						Aur. Acut. 1, 10, 71</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praetacta membra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2, 11, 79</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
